<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <title>JUST 长缝光谱仪控制面板</title>
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #020617;
      --bg-panel: #020617;
      --bg-elevated: #0b1120;
      --accent: #3b82f6;
      --accent-soft: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.15);
      --border: #1f2937;
      --border-strong: #4b5563;
      --text: #e5e7eb;
      --muted: #9ca3af;
      --danger: #f97373;
      --success: #4ade80;
      --shadow: 0 18px 45px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      --radius-xl: 18px;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; }

    html, body {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      height: 100%;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, #020617 0%, #000 55%, #020617 100%);
      color: var(--text);
    }

    body {
      display: flex;
      align-items: stretch;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 16px;
    }

    .app {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 1300px;
      background: linear-gradient(165deg, rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9), rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.98));
      border-radius: 24px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.7);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      padding: 18px 20px 14px;
      gap: 16px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .app::before {
      content: "";
      position: absolute;
      inset: -120px;
      background:
        radial-gradient(circle at 0% 0%, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.18), transparent 55%),
        radial-gradient(circle at 105% -5%, rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.18), transparent 55%);
      opacity: 0.9;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }

    .app-inner {
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .app-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding: 10px 12px;
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at left top, rgba(15,23,42,0.8), rgba(15,23,42,0.95));
      border: 1px solid rgba(75,85,99,0.6);
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .title-block {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 4px;
      min-width: 260px;
    }

    .title-main {
      font-size: 20px;
      font-weight: 650;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .title-tag {
      font-size: 11px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .badge-pill {
      padding: 5px 11px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      font-size: 11px;
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .status-badges {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      margin-left: auto;
    }

    .badge {
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.7);
      background-color: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .badge-dot {
      width: 8px;
      height: 8px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--muted);
      box-shadow: 0 0 12px rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.9);
    }

    .badge-dot--ok {
      background: var(--success);
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.9);
    }

    .badge-dot--error {
      background: #f97373;
      box-shadow: 0 0 14px rgba(248, 113, 113, 0.95);
    }

    .btn {
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148, 163, 184, 0.5);
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.9);
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 12px;
      padding: 5px 11px;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6);
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: linear-gradient(to right, rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.95), rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.95));
      border: none;
      color: #0b1120;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .btn-primary:hover {
      filter: brightness(1.06);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(191, 219, 254, 0.9), 0 12px 30px rgba(37, 99, 235, 0.65);
    }

    .btn-sm { padding: 4px 9px; font-size: 11px; }

    .btn:disabled {
      opacity: 0.6;
      cursor: default;
      box-shadow: none;
      border-color: rgba(75, 85, 99, 0.7);
    }

    .hint { font-size: 10px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 2px; }

    .time-block {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 2px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.9);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.95), #020617);
      font-size: 11px;
      min-width: 120px;
    }

    .time-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; gap: 6px; }
    .time-label { color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 10px; }

    .baseurl-box {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      padding: 4px 8px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.9);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.95), #020617);
    }

    .baseurl-box label {
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--muted);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      margin-right: 2px;
    }

    .baseurl-box input[type="text"] {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      padding: 4px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      outline: none;
      width: 240px;
      max-width: 52vw;
    }

    .baseurl-box input[type="text"]:focus {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6);
    }

    .tabs {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 4px;
      padding: 4px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.95), #020617);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.9);
      overflow-x: auto;
    }

    .tab {
      flex: 0 0 auto;
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 5px 14px;
      font-size: 12px;
      border: 1px solid transparent;
      color: var(--muted);
      cursor: pointer;
      background: transparent;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
      white-space: nowrap;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }

    .tab:hover {
      color: var(--text);
      border-color: rgba(75,85,99,0.9);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
    }

    .tab-active {
      color: #e5edff;
      font-weight: 500;
      border-color: rgba(59,130,246,0.9);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(37,99,235,0.9), rgba(59,130,246,0.5));
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(191,219,254,0.9), 0 10px 26px rgba(30,64,175,0.8);
    }

    .tab:disabled {
      opacity: 0.45;
      cursor: not-allowed;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .tab-pill {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.4);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .tab-content { margin-top: 4px; }
    .tab-panel { display: none; }
    .tab-panel-active { display: block; }

    .panel {
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.96), rgba(3,7,18,0.98));
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 12px 12px 10px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 10px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .panel-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .panel-title {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: #e5e7eb;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .panel-kicker { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }
    .panel-actions { display: flex; gap: 6px; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }

    .layout-2col {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.3fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .layout-2col.layout-overview-main {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.5fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .layout-2col { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    }

    .control-group {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      .control-group { grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr); }
    }

    .control-card {
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top, rgba(15,23,42,0.95), #020617);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.9);
      padding: 9px 10px 9px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .control-title {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .control-sub { font-size: 11px; color: var(--muted); }

    .form-row {
      display: flex;
      gap: 6px;
      align-items: center;
      margin-top: 4px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    label {
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    input[type="number"], input[type="text"], select, textarea {
      background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.95);
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      padding: 5px 10px;
      font-size: 12px;
      color: var(--text);
      min-width: 0;
      flex: 1;
      outline: none;
    }

    textarea {
      border-radius: 12px;
      resize: vertical;
      min-height: 80px;
      font-family: inherit;
    }

    input:focus, select:focus, textarea:focus {
      border-color: rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.9);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.6);
    }

    .status-summary {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 8px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 900px) {
      .status-summary { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
    }

    .status-chip {
      padding: 6px 8px;
      border-radius: 13px;
      background: radial-gradient(circle at top left, rgba(15,23,42,0.9), #020617);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55, 65, 81, 0.9);
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 3px;
    }

    .status-chip-label {
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    }

    .status-chip-value { font-weight: 500; font-size: 13px; }

    .status-raw {
      margin-top: 6px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31,41,55,0.9);
      padding: 8px 10px;
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: #cbd5f5;
      max-height: 240px;
      overflow: auto;
    }

    .table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      font-size: 11px;
      margin-top: 4px;
    }

    .table th, .table td {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.9);
      padding: 4px 6px;
      text-align: left;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .table thead { background: rgba(15,23,42,0.8); }
    .table th { font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted); }

    .pill-soft {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-size: 10px;
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.95);
      border: 1px solid rgba(55,65,81,0.9);
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .pill-ok { border-color: rgba(34,197,94,0.7); color: #bbf7d0; }
    .pill-na { border-color: rgba(248,113,113,0.6); color: #fecaca; }

    .log-panel {
      border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
      border: 1px solid rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.95);
      background: radial-gradient(circle at bottom, rgba(15,23,42,0.96), #020617);
      padding: 9px 12px 8px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 6px;
      max-height: 220px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .log-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .log-list {
      list-style: none;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      overflow-y: auto;
      max-height: 160px;
      font-size: 11px;
    }

    .log-item {
      padding: 2px 0;
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
      align-items: baseline;
      border-bottom: 1px dashed rgba(31, 41, 55, 0.7);
    }

    .log-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }

    .log-time {
      font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace;
      color: var(--muted);
      flex: 0 0 84px;
    }

    .log-text { flex: 1; white-space: pre-wrap; word-break: break-word; }
    .log-text--error { color: var(--danger); }
    .log-text--success { color: var(--success); }

    .todo-list {
      margin: 4px 0 0;
      padding-left: 18px;
      font-size: 11px;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .todo-list li { margin: 2px 0; }

    .pill-todo {
      font-size: 10px;
      padding: 2px 6px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(148,163,184,0.5);
      color: var(--muted);
      background: rgba(15,23,42,0.9);
    }

    .kv {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 180px 1fr 1.5fr;
      gap: 6px;
      font-size: 11px;
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(31,41,55,0.7);
      padding-top: 6px;
    }

    .kv .k { color: var(--muted); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.08em; font-size: 10px; padding-top: 2px; }
    .kv .v { font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, "Liberation Mono", "Courier New", monospace; color: #cbd5f5; }
    .kv .d { color: var(--muted); }

    @media (max-width: 720px) {
      .kv { grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr; }
      .kv .d { grid-column: 1 / -1; padding-left: 0; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="app">
    <div class="app-inner">
      <header class="app-header">
        <div class="title-block">
          <div class="title-main">
            JUST 长缝光谱仪控制
            <span class="badge-pill">Local Console · v0.2</span>
          </div>
          <div class="title-tag">LONG-SLIT SPECTROGRAPH · INSTRUMENT LOCAL UI</div>
        </div>

        <div class="status-badges">
          <div class="time-block">
            <div class="time-row">
              <span class="time-label">Local</span>
              <span id="time-local">--:--:--</span>
            </div>
            <div class="time-row">
              <span class="time-label">UTC</span>
              <span id="time-utc">--:--:--</span>
            </div>
            <div class="time-row">
              <span class="time-label">LST</span>
              <span id="time-lst">--:--:--</span>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="baseurl-box">
            <label for="api-base-input">API</label>
            <input id="api-base-input" type="text" spellcheck="false" />
            <button class="btn btn-sm" id="api-base-save">保存</button>
            <button class="btn btn-sm" id="api-base-reset">重置</button>
          </div>

          <div class="badge" id="connection-badge" title="连接状态（基于 /api/v1/status/full 轮询）">
            <span class="badge-dot" id="connection-dot"></span>
            <span id="connection-text">未连接</span>
          </div>

          <div class="badge" title="RTT / 最近成功 / 连续失败 / 当前轮询间隔">
            <span id="conn-metrics">RTT — · OK — · FAIL 0 · 1.0s</span>
          </div>

          <button class="btn btn-sm" id="refresh-status-btn">刷新</button>
        </div>
      </header>

      <nav class="tabs" id="main-tabs">
        <button class="tab tab-active" data-tab="overview">总览 <span class="tab-pill">Overview</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="env">环境监测 <span class="tab-pill">Env</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="slit">狭缝与监测 <span class="tab-pill">Slit</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="cal">定标 <span class="tab-pill">Cal</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="guiding">偏置导星 <span class="tab-pill">Guider</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="cameras">三通道相机 <span class="tab-pill">B/G/R</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="quicklook">数据快显 <span class="tab-pill">Quicklook</span></button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="logs">日志 <span class="tab-pill">Logs</span></button>
      </nav>

      <main class="tab-content">
        <!-- Overview -->
        <section class="tab-panel tab-panel-active" data-tab-panel="overview">
          <div class="layout-2col layout-overview-main">
            <section class="panel">
              <div class="panel-header">
                <div>
                  <div class="panel-title">模块能力 / Capabilities</div>
                  <div class="panel-kicker">来自 <code>/api/v1/status/full</code> 的 capabilities（用于占位模块启用/禁用）</div>
                </div>
                <div class="panel-actions">
                  <span class="pill-soft" id="pill-runmode">RUN_MODE —</span>
                  <span class="pill-soft" id="pill-hal">HAL —</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <table class="table">
                <thead>
                  <tr>
                    <th>模块</th>
                    <th>状态</th>
                    <th>说明</th>
                  </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="cap-table-body"></tbody>
              </table>

              <div class="hint">说明：外部 OCS/TCS/队列不在本 Sprint 范围，UI 仅保留占位，不对接实际控制。</div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel">
              <div class="panel-header">
                <div>
                  <div class="panel-title">快速控制 / Quick Controls</div>
                  <div class="panel-kicker">真实可控项：狭缝 / 光栅 / 主定标灯（v0.1 契约）</div>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="control-group">
                <div class="control-card">
                  <div class="control-title">
                    狭缝宽度
                    <span class="control-sub">POST /api/v1/slit</span>
                  </div>
                  <form id="slit-form">
                    <div class="form-row">
                      <label for="slit-width">宽度</label>
                      <input type="number" step="0.1" id="slit-width" required />
                      <select id="slit-unit" style="max-width: 120px; flex: 0 0 auto;">
                        <option value="um">μm</option>
                        <option value="arcsec">arcsec</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hint">后端要求：<code>{"width_um": 0 &lt; x ≤ 5000}</code>。若以 arcsec 输入，将按 128.34 μm/arcsec 换算。</div>
                    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top:8px; justify-content:flex-end;">
                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="slit-submit-btn">应用</button>
                    </div>
                  </form>
                </div>

                <div class="control-card">
                  <div class="control-title">
                    光栅选择
                    <span class="control-sub">POST /api/v1/grating</span>
                  </div>
                  <form id="grating-form">
                    <div class="form-row">
                      <label for="grating-name">光栅</label>
                      <select id="grating-name" required>
                        <option value="G1">G1</option>
                        <option value="G2">G2（占位）</option>
                        <option value="G3">G3（占位）</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hint">后端要求：<code>{"name": "G1"}</code>。当前 demo_flow 固定使用 G1；其它选项是否支持取决于 HAL/实现。</div>
                    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top:8px; justify-content:flex-end;">
                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="grating-submit-btn">应用</button>
                    </div>
                  </form>
                </div>

                <div class="control-card">
                  <div class="control-title">
                    主定标灯
                    <span class="control-sub">POST /api/v1/lamp</span>
                  </div>
                  <form id="lamp-form">
                    <div class="form-row">
                      <label for="lamp-on">灯状态</label>
                      <select id="lamp-on">
                        <option value="true">ON</option>
                        <option value="false">OFF</option>
                      </select>
                    </div>
                    <div class="hint">后端要求：<code>{"on": true|false}</code>。多光源（Ne/HgAr/ThAr/FeAr/氘卤）在本 Sprint 仅做占位。</div>
                    <div class="form-row" style="margin-top:8px; justify-content:flex-end;">
                      <button type="submit" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" id="lamp-submit-btn">应用</button>
                    </div>
                  </form>
                </div>

                <div class="control-card">
                  <div class="control-title">
                    工具
                    <span class="control-sub">Utilities</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="form-row">
                    <button class="btn btn-sm" type="button" id="quick-refresh-btn">刷新状态</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm" type="button" id="copy-log-btn">复制日志</button>
                    <button class="btn btn-sm" type="button" id="clear-log-btn">清空日志</button>
                  </div>
                  <div class="hint">复制日志用于现场排障；无需打开 DevTools。</div>
                </div>
              </div>
            </section>
          </div>

          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <div class="panel-title">仪器状态 / Instrument Status</div>
                <div class="panel-kicker">轮询：<code>/api/v1/status/full</code>（失败则降级 <code>/api/v1/status</code>）</div>
              </div>
              <div class="panel-actions">
                <span class="hint" id="status-freshness">Last OK: —</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="status-summary">
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">SLIT</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-slit">—</div>
              </div>
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">GRATING</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-grating">—</div>
              </div>
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">CAL LAMP</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-lamp">—</div>
              </div>
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">TEMP</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-temp">—</div>
              </div>
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">SOURCE</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-source">—</div>
              </div>
              <div class="status-chip">
                <div class="status-chip-label">SERVER UTC</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="chip-server-utc">—</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="control-card">
              <div class="control-title">字段解释 <span class="control-sub">Readable Table</span></div>
              <div class="kv">
                <div class="k">slit_width_um</div>
                <div class="v" id="kv-slit-um">—</div>
                <div class="d">狭缝宽度（μm），后端约束：0 &lt; x ≤ 5000</div>

                <div class="k">slit_width_arcsec</div>
                <div class="v" id="kv-slit-arcsec">—</div>
                <div class="d">按 128.34 μm/arcsec 换算（操作层更直观）</div>

                <div class="k">grating</div>
                <div class="v" id="kv-grating">—</div>
                <div class="d">当前光栅档位（枚举/字符串）</div>

                <div class="k">lamp_on</div>
                <div class="v" id="kv-lamp">—</div>
                <div class="d">主定标灯开关（多光源细分在后续 API 扩展）</div>

                <div class="k">temperature_c</div>
                <div class="v" id="kv-temp">—</div>
                <div class="d">温度（℃，当前为模拟或设备读数）</div>
              </div>
            </div>

            <div class="status-raw">
              <pre id="status-raw-pre" style="margin:0; white-space:pre-wrap; word-break:break-word;">等待首次状态刷新...</pre>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="log-panel">
            <div class="log-header">
              <span>事件日志 / Event Log</span>
              <span id="log-hint">最多保留 200 条</span>
            </div>
            <ul class="log-list" id="log-list"></ul>
          </section>
        </section>

        <!-- Env -->
        <section class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="env">
          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <div class="panel-title">观测环境监测 / Environment</div>
                <div class="panel-kicker">本 Sprint 不实现外部气象站接入；仅做占位与能力标识</div>
              </div>
              <div class="panel-actions">
                <span class="pill-todo" id="env-pill">TODO：env_sensors API</span>
              </div>
