            <div class="control-group">
              <div class="control-card">
                <div class="control-title">温度 <span class="control-sub">Temperature</span></div>
                <div class="hint">可先复用 status.temperature_c 作为“仪器/机箱温度”，后续再引入湿度/风速/视宁度等。</div>
                <div class="status-chip-value" id="env-temp">—</div>
