                </div>
                <div class="panel-actions">
                  <span class="pill-soft" id="slit-cap-pill">cap: slit</span>
                </div>
              </div>

              <div class="control-card">
                <div class="control-title">宽度设置 <span class="control-sub">Width</span></div>
                <div class="hint">建议操作层以 arcsec 记忆，但实际控制用 μm；本页提供双单位显示与输入。</div>
                <form id="slit-form-2">
                  <div class="form-row">
                    <label for="slit2-width">宽度</label>
                    <input type="number" step="0.1" id="slit2-width" required />
                    <select id="slit2-unit" style="max-width: 120px; flex: 0 0 auto;">
                      <option value="arcsec">arcsec</option>
