                <ul class="todo-list">
                  <li>本 Sprint 不实现图像流接口。</li>
                  <li>后续可增加：最新帧缩略图 + 狭缝宽度测量结果（μm / arcsec）。</li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </section>

            <section class="panel">
              <div class="panel-header">
                <div>
                  <div class="panel-title">狭缝读数 / Readback</div>
                  <div class="panel-kicker">来自状态轮询（同 Overview）</div>
                </div>
