              <li>显示导星相机在线状态、曝光参数（占位）</li>
              <li>导星星选择与 guiding loop（占位）</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
        </section>

        <!-- Cameras -->
        <section class="tab-panel" data-tab-panel="cameras">
          <section class="panel">
            <div class="panel-header">
              <div>
                <div class="panel-title">三通道相机 / B-G-R (占位)</div>
                <div class="panel-kicker">本 Sprint 不实现相机曝光控制；仅占位与能力标识</div>
              </div>
              <div class="panel-actions">
                <span class="pill-soft" id="cameras-cap-pill">cap: science_channels_bgr</span>
                <span class="pill-todo">TODO：camera API</span>
              </div>
            </div>
            <ul class="todo-list">
              <li>蓝/绿/红通道：曝光参数、快门、触发（占位）</li>
              <li>最近一帧缩略图 + 打开 ds9（占位）</li>
            </ul>
          </section>
